\title{sampleTidy: Ingest and Reconcile Environmental Monitoring Sample Data}
\description{
An email-triggered pipeline that ingests environmental monitoring results from heterogeneous laboratory and field sources (CSV, XLS/XLSX, PDF), reconciles them against a canonical analyte, feature and method registry, and stores them in a DuckDB-backed monitoring database with links to the archived original files. Lab- and format-specific parsers ("adapters") emit a common intermediate representation, so new laboratories, samplers or file formats can be added without touching the shared ingestion, reconciliation and storage machinery. Part of the 'tidyWaste' family of packages.
